1031
01:34:54,960 --> 01:35:02,240
相反，他回到了经典的软件工程书籍。比如《Pragmatic Programmer》、《Philosophy of Software Design》和《Domain-driven design》。
Instead, he went back to classic software engineering books. The Pragmatic Programmer, a Philosophy of Software Design, and Domain-driven design.

1032
01:35:02,400 --> 01:35:09,440
这里有一种讽刺意味：那些在 20 多年前记录下来的最佳实践，比如这本书中提到的战术层面的与战略编程的对比，
There's some irony as to how the best practices documented 20 plus years ago, like tactical versus strategic programming in this book,

1033
01:35:09,680 --> 01:35:14,240
不仅依然有效，而且在利用 AI 智能体编写代码时变得更加重要。
not only do they still work, but they become more important when writing code with AI agents.

1034
01:35:14,400 --> 01:35:18,480
